y: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">다자녀</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">생활</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">재능장학금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(5</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">종</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">지원대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">대학교 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">휴학생 및 정규 학제 기간 초과자 신청불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">선발 예정인원 및 지급금액 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">331</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.7pt; font-family: Gulim,